        },
        {
          "text": " “Ejaas nen ikapolok luka agolitomei, kes kere, ka Isidonin kere, luejesaros nepepe kaluearitai; karaida keyaunete etasuro kanuka agogonukec, irumete ileic; eperete mam ekepitai nepepe kanul kalueari ekileŋ; ibwokito ikeeeleic nepepe kanul kaluiiesaros Aipany.",
